===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Ledian|7}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*'''Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Machop|59}} from the {{TCG|Team Rocket}} expansion.
